message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript using the metadata below."
title: "Accounting for recurrent mutation in the frequency spectrum of rare alleles"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-21"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Deepgh/smfs-inference"
abstract: "Software accompanying the manuscript Accounting for recurrent mutation in the frequency spectrum of rare alleles. The code supports simulation of recurrent mutations, estimation of the single mutation frequency spectrum (SMFS), and analysis of rare-allele site frequency spectra under recurrent mutation."
